\ A bound value for `inline_literal.1z` to read from the other side of an import.
\
\ A binding is `.literal` only inside its own defining frame. Reached through an import it is
\ already the one-instruction push body `moduleWordFor` turned it into. The two readers below and
\ beside them in the importing file are what show that both forms expand to the same thing.

\\ The value both sides read.
gap: ( -- n: fixnum ) const inline 8 ;

\\ Read the binding from the module that defined it.
here-gap: ( -- n: fixnum ) [ gap ] ;
